  "description": "Jake Glacer built one of the simplest apps I've ever seen. You almost can't believe it makes any money. But Jake found a viral idea, started marketing from the very beginning, and grew to over $50K/month in just 4 months. In this video, we break down how something this simple actually works and why a niche app like this is so easy to market.\n\n*iOS App Ideas:* https://go.starterstory.com/ios-app-ideas-lm-description\n\nFollow Jake: https://www.linkedin.com/in/jakeglacer/\nCheck out Erly: https://erly.co/\n\n🔔 Follow the Second Channel: @StarterStoryBuild \n🏁 We're hiring: starterstory.com/jobs\n\nChapters:\n0:00 - Simples app idea ever?\n0:59 - What’s your story?\n1:24 - What’s the app?\n2:22 - Founder background\n3:00 - More simple iOS app ideas\n4:03 - Finding the idea\n5:59 - Build the app\n7:27 - How to find successful ideas\n8:59 - Growth and marketing\n9:59 - Marketing example\n11:05 - Deal structure \n11:52 - Tracking marketing results \n13:01 - Tech stack\n13:59 - App demo\n14:50 - Final advice: focus on marketing\n15:51 - Pat and Gus reflections: a crazy simple idea\n\nThis video is an educational case study of this founder’s experience. It is not financial advice and does not guarantee any income or results. Every business is different and your results may vary.",
